                        "entry_id": "e2681034-642f-31bb-a55b-7618d0816c36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to illnesses involving difficulties in processing chlorides, especially nephritis in which the kidneys have trouble excreting chlorides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ceb84984-5787-4349-9b54-a1eda58305de",
                                "sense_id": "72082320-0206-3884-a8ac-dea067a41024",
                                "text": "In the chloremic form there may occur pharyngolaryngeal edema, pulmonary edema, hydrothorax, digestive troubles, including vomiting and diarrhea, headache, eclampsia, coma, Cheyene-Stokes respiration, and visual troubles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af8c6bae-bbe6-43f9-8c9e-80a1cd53abb8",
                                "sense_id": "72082320-0206-3884-a8ac-dea067a41024",
                                "text": "One rarely sees however, a pure azotemic, or chloremic form, but usually a combination of these various forms is present."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
